NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key
GEOAPIFY_API_KEY=your-geoapify-api-key

# For deployment on Vercel, set the above in the project environment variables.

# Notes:
# - `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` and `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` are safe to be public in the browser.
# - `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` must be kept secret and only set in server environment variables (Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables).
